---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="how" title="In the spirit of PyTorch">
  <div class="how-body">
    <p class="intro">
      OpenJarvis is built around composable primitives — engine, agents, tools, memory, skills,
      recipes, and scheduler — that you assemble freely, the same way you compose layers in
      PyTorch. Each primitive is a typed registry entry; swap, extend, or replace any piece
      without touching the rest of the stack. Cloud APIs are optional: the same code runs
      entirely on your hardware or routes selectively to the cloud.
    </p>
    <div class="arch-wrap">
      <div class="arch-chrome" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="adot"></span><span class="adot"></span><span class="adot"></span>
        <span class="arch-filename">OpenJarvis_Architecture.png</span>
      </div>
      <img
        src="/architecture.png"
        alt="OpenJarvis architecture diagram showing the composable primitives: engine, agents, tools, memory, skills, recipes, and scheduler"
        loading="lazy"
        class="arch-img"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  .how-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .intro {
    max-width: 68ch;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .arch-wrap {
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: var(--color-surface);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35),
                0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent) 7%, transparent);
  }

  .arch-chrome {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-surface-strong) 80%, transparent);
  }
  .adot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .adot:nth-child(1) { background: #ff5f56; }
  .adot:nth-child(2) { background: #ffbd2e; }
  .adot:nth-child(3) { background: #27c93f; }
  .arch-filename {
    margin-left: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
  }

  .arch-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }
</style>
